From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 21:02:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Port block events to region-based system

- Add block events (ObjectLinkedOpenHashSet) to LevelChunkRegion
- Add addBlockEvent and forEachRegionInBoundingBox to LevelChunkRegionMap
- Update ServerLevel to use region-based block events
- Hook runBlockEvents into ConfettiChunkTicker._tickRegion()
- Use ThreadLocal for blockEventsToReschedule

